Package: colorkit
Title: Tools for Color Display, Conversion, and Sampling
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Daniel", "Muenz", , "dmuenz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Utility functions for working with colors in R. Includes
    tools for converting colors to hexadecimal strings, selecting
    contrasting foreground colors for a given background, randomly
    sampling colors, and displaying colors visually as plotted cells or
    printed console output.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    cli,
    farver,
    gtable,
    rlang
Suggests:
    RColorBrewer
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://dmuenz.github.io/colorkit/
